  "Lets the agent send and read WeCom messages, and work with docs, sheets, calendars, and to-dos from the command line. {tail}": "Permite al agente enviar y leer mensajes de WeCom y gestionar documentos, hojas, calendarios y tareas por l\xEDnea de comandos. {tail}",
