  "Find Meetings, Cola, Knowledge, Extensions, and Redact here. Pin favorites to the sidebar.": "Aqu\xED encontrar\xE1s Reuniones, Cola, Conocimiento, Extensiones y Censura. Fija tus favoritos en la barra lateral.",
  Guide: "Gu\xEDa",
  "Type /swarm or /teamwork in chat to launch collaborators in parallel. Switch between Orbit, Flow, and Board above, or click a member to inspect progress.": "Escribe /swarm o /teamwork en el chat para lanzar colaboradores en paralelo. Cambia entre \xD3rbita, Flujo y Tablero arriba, o haz clic en un miembro para ver su progreso.",
